  "title": "SL2 tilting modules in the mixed case",
  "authors_raw": "LOUISE SUTTON, DANIEL TUBBENHAUER, PAUL WEDRICH, AND JIERUZHU",
  "title_lines": [
   "SL2 TILTING MODULES IN THE MIXED CASE"
  ],
  "abstract": "Using the non-semisimple Temperley\u2013Lieb calculus, we study the additive and monoidal structure of the category of tilting modules for SL2 in the mixed case. This simultane- ously generalizes the semisimple situation, the case of the complex quantum group at a root of unity, and the algebraic group case in positive characteristic. We describe character formulas and give a presentation of the category of tilting modules as an additive category via a quiver with relations. Turning to the monoidal structure, we describe fusion rules and obtain an explicit recursive description of the appropriate analog of Jones\u2013Wenzl projectors.",
